    <!-- TUITION / FEES -->
    <section id="tuition" class="band-sand">
        <div class="wrap donate-box">
            <div class="eyebrow">Tuition &amp; Fees</div>
            <h2>Fees, bursaries, and how to give</h2>
            <p>School fees cover tuition, meals, and learning materials for each term. Detailed termly fee structures by class are shared directly with parents at enrolment and can be requested through the Contacts section below.</p>
            <p>Every term, some of our brightest pupils risk missing class simply because their families cannot afford tuition or scholastic materials. That's why we run a bursary programme, supported by donors and well-wishers, so that no child's circumstances decide whether they get to learn.</p>
            <ul class="donate-list">
                <li>Fund tuition for a pupil in need</li>
                <li>Provide scholastic materials — books, pens, uniforms</li>
                <li>Sponsor a full bursary for a term or a year</li>
                <li>Support general school running costs</li>
            </ul>
            <!--<a class="btn gold" href="/#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Support a bursary</a>-->
            <button class="btn gold" id="bank-btn" type="button">Support a bursary</button>
        </div>
    </section>

