            <p>Biggi Junior School respects the privacy of everyone who visits this website, including parents, pupils, donors, and partners.</p>
            <h4>Information we collect</h4>
            <p>We only collect information you choose to share with us, such as your name, email, and message when you use our enquiry form.</p>
            <h4>How we use it</h4>
            <p>Information submitted through this site is used solely to respond to your enquiry or process your support for the school, and is never sold to third parties.</p>
            <h4>Cookies</h4>
            <p>This site may use minimal cookies to remember basic preferences during your visit. No tracking or advertising cookies are used.</p>
            <h4>Contact us</h4>
            <p>If you have questions about this policy, please reach out via the enquiry form in our contact section.</p>
        </div>
